    "Description": "Copy of a letter from Richard C. Mehring, Acting Department Consultant for Historic Architecture, Technical Preservation Services Division, to Mrs. William Farley on July 26, 1977. The letter indicates that the grant recipient can be transferred from the Raleigh Fine Arts Society to the City of Raleigh.  The letter also talks about the paint research and re-coating of the animals on the Pullen Park Carousel. At the top, \"Ann of Ohio,\" is written in blue ink. \"Who made the proposal\" is written in the right margin, with a line pointing towards a bracketed and underlined portion of the letter. Signed at the bottom by Richard C. Mehring. ",
